canvas                  Graphics device for drawing to a HTML canvas
                        element
canvas_install          Use the webR canvas graphics device
eval_js                 Evaluate JavaScript code
eval_r                  Evaluate R code for webR
global_prompt_install   Prompt user to install missing packages from a
                        webR binary repo
install                 Install one or more packages from a webR binary
                        package repo
pager_install           Generate an output message when file is
                        displayed with the pager
test_package            Test an installed R package by running the
                        package examples and tests
